WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.464 --> 00:00:15.835
The cook led Vinnie and Helene to the kitchen.

2
00:00:17.096 --> 00:00:19.457
She put the rabbits on a long table.

3
00:00:20.798 --> 00:00:23.040
The kitchen was full of busy people.

4
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.263
"You!" The cook pointed to Vinnie.

5
00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:27.984
"Start peeling!"

6
00:00:30.192 --> 00:00:32.653
Vinnie sat down at a pile of onions.

7
00:00:33.313 --> 00:00:35.474
Sighing, he began to peel them.

8
00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:38.614
Vinnie wondered what happened to Mandy.

9
00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:44.436
"I haven't seen you here before," said a kitchen boy.

10
00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:46.116
He grinned at Vinnie.

11
00:00:46.136 --> 00:00:49.017
"I'm new," said Vinnie.

12
00:00:49.037 --> 00:00:51.158
"Why is everyone so nervous?"

13
00:00:51.178 --> 00:00:54.239
"Our king is very picky.

14
00:00:54.699 --> 00:00:56.879
He likes his food cooked a certain way.

15
00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:03.843
If it isn't"—the boy shuddered—"you're in big trouble!"

16
00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.805
"What will he do?"

17
00:01:06.585 --> 00:01:07.366
Vinnie gulped.

18
00:01:07.386 --> 00:01:11.929
"You don't want to know," said the boy.

19
00:01:13.771 --> 00:01:17.914
Meanwhile, Mandy was trying to find her way out of the palace.

20
00:01:18.994 --> 00:01:21.416
"I wish I knew where Helene was!"

21
00:01:22.097 --> 00:01:22.757
she cried.

22
00:01:23.938 --> 00:01:26.200
She walked down a dark flight of stairs.

23
00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:31.122
"This part of the palace is very different," she thought.

24
00:01:32.243 --> 00:01:34.104
The rooms were small and shabby.

25
00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:37.526
Mandy knocked on a door.

26
00:01:38.106 --> 00:01:39.186
She poked her head in.

27
00:01:39.206 --> 00:01:41.628
"Hello?" she said.

28
00:01:41.648 --> 00:01:44.769
"Elise? Is that you?"

29
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:46.450
someone called.

30
00:01:47.571 --> 00:01:48.591
Mandy walked in.

31
00:01:49.152 --> 00:01:51.293
She found a sick woman in a bed.

32
00:01:52.594 --> 00:01:53.654
The room was damp.

33
00:01:53.674 --> 00:01:58.196
"I'm looking for Helene," said Mandy.

34
00:01:59.197 --> 00:02:00.277
The woman coughed.

35
00:02:00.297 --> 00:02:04.359
"Helene? Simone's daughter?

36
00:02:05.019 --> 00:02:05.800
She's not here."

37
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.421
Mandy felt very bad for the woman.

38
00:02:09.441 --> 00:02:11.842
"Can I bring you some tea?"

39
00:02:12.403 --> 00:02:13.003
she asked.

40
00:02:14.163 --> 00:02:15.224
She shook her head.

41
00:02:15.244 --> 00:02:19.526
"If His Highness knows I am sick, I will be thrown out.

42
00:02:20.526 --> 00:02:21.767
Please do not tell."

43
00:02:22.967 --> 00:02:24.588
Mandy promised she wouldn't.

44
00:02:26.848 --> 00:02:31.031
"King Louis and his friends live in luxury," she thought.

45
00:02:31.051 --> 00:02:33.713
"But the servants do not.

46
00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:37.835
How do the rest of the French people live?"

47
00:02:38.516 --> 00:02:39.417
wondered Mandy.

48
00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.719
In the kitchen, Vinnie's eyes were watering.

49
00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.942
The onions made his eyes sting.

50
00:02:47.582 --> 00:02:49.303
He stood up to wipe his eyes.

51
00:02:50.044 --> 00:02:52.645
Vinnie's elbow hit a bowl of green leaves.

52
00:02:53.526 --> 00:02:56.168
The bowl tipped and spilled on the table.

53
00:02:57.268 --> 00:02:59.049
"Uh-oh," he said.

54
00:02:59.069 --> 00:03:01.390
"Be careful with that!"

55
00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.090
said the kitchen boy.

56
00:03:03.691 --> 00:03:05.671
He was heading into the next room.

57
00:03:05.691 --> 00:03:08.152
"It looks like parsley.

58
00:03:09.173 --> 00:03:12.574
But that bitter herb can make you sick if you eat too much."

59
00:03:14.075 --> 00:03:17.016
Vinnie scooped the bitter herb back into the bowl.

60
00:03:18.076 --> 00:03:21.058
The cook called out, "Give me that parsley!

61
00:03:21.698 --> 00:03:22.818
I need it for the soup!"

62
00:03:23.499 --> 00:03:25.159
Vinnie looked at him, puzzled.

63
00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:26.620
"What parsley?"

64
00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:27.740
he asked.

65
00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.601
"In your hand!"

66
00:03:31.161 --> 00:03:32.081
the cook yelled.

67
00:03:32.101 --> 00:03:36.283
"But this isn't—," Vinnie began.

68
00:03:37.323 --> 00:03:38.663
The cook grabbed the bowl.

69
00:03:38.683 --> 00:03:40.944
"Get back to the onions!"

70
00:03:41.504 --> 00:03:42.204
he screamed.

71
00:03:43.244 --> 00:03:46.045
Then he poured the bitter herb into the soup.

72
00:03:47.426 --> 00:03:49.006
Vinnie's eyes grew big.

73
00:03:49.026 --> 00:03:51.287
"But, sir," he began.

74
00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:53.327
It was too late.

75
00:03:54.007 --> 00:03:55.888
The cook put the soup on a tray.

76
00:03:56.864 --> 00:04:00.531
"This is the king's favorite," the cook said to a servant.

77
00:04:00.551 --> 00:04:02.935
"Take it to him at once."
